===Etymology===
From {{inh|sq|sqj-pro|*widertjā}}, with loss of the first unstressed syllable, from {{inh|sq|ine-pro|*sweyd-}} (compare {{cog|grc|ἱδρώς}}, {{cog|en|sweat}}, {{cog|it|sudore}}).<ref>{{R:sq:Orel|page=69}}</ref> For Albanian ''d'' < PIE ''*sw'' compare {{m|sq|diell}}.

